  "goodToKnow": "Biblisch means biblical: biblische Geschichten, biblische Namen. Ein biblisches Alter erreichen means to reach a ripe old age, like Methuselah. Biblische Ausmaße are biblical proportions, of floods or plagues. Martin Luther's translation of the Bible (New Testament 1522, complete 1534) shaped modern standard German and gave it many expressions still used today."
